Content Delivery Network (CDN):
- distributed caching servers

Virtual Private Network (VPN):
- concentrator/head-end - encryption/decryption access device (usually part of firewall)

Quality of Service (QoS):
- traffic shaping, packet shaping
- control applications bandwidth usage by setting priorities

Time to Live (TTL):
- number of hops, certain time has elapsed
- drop packet caught in a loop, clear a cache